EVALUATION.md §11.3: the portable subset escapes only a class (\d \D \w \W \s \S) or a metacharacter; RE2-only escapes are E1904: quoting, octal, hex, control and Unicode escapes, \A \z \b \B, and an escaped `-` outside a class.
